## Key Artifacts
- /tmp/manual_web_e7d2ef75620f/single_quote_exploit/: single-quote Nmap file-read/write exploit outputs
- /flag.txt, /flag2.txt, /flag.gnmap, /flag.xml: web probes after exploit

## Flags Found
